OL,3,GNEWSA'Until we have answers - our grief
OL,4,Ais frozen in time' - dad of teenager
OL,5,Akilled in explosion
OL,6,
OL,7,FLeona Harper's coat still hangs in the
OL,8,Fhallway of her family home.
OL,10,FThe soil from the pitch of the last
OL,11,Fgame she played is still on her rugby
OL,12,Fboots.
OL,14,FHer bedroom remains untouched.
OL,16,FFour years on from the Creeslough
OL,17,Fexplosion that claimed the 14-year-old
OL,18,Fschoolgirl's life, along with nine
OL,19,Fothers, her father says their family
OL,20,Fremains "desperate for answers" about
OL,21,Fthe events of that day.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
